    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43964" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθερά̆π-ευτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to cure</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				501
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.16.6
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easy to help</i> or <i>remedy</i>, <i><span class="en">
