				38.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>easily won by kindness</i> or <i>attention</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.2.10
			</span></i>.</div>
